{"id":8451164,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-nn/merge_requests/3217","number":3217,"state":"merged","title":"修复scatterNdUpdate indices 越界问题","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-nn/pulls/3217","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-nn/pulls/3217/issues","body":"## 描述\nscatter_nd_update算子当indices张量中的索引值超出目标变量var的有效范围（小于0或大于等于对应轴维度大小）时，内核会无条件执行内存写入，导致数组越界访问，引发未定程序崩溃，测试人员测试indices 越界场景算子报错，竞品和71都没有报错。\n<!--在这里详细描述你的改动，包括改动的原因和所采取的方法。-->\n\n## 关联的Issue\nhttps://gitcode.com/cann/ops-nn/issues/1760\n<!-- 如果这个PR是为了解决特定的Issue，请在这里提供Issue链接。例如：关联Issue #000-->\n\n## 测试\n1. 构造scatterNdUpdate 算子 indices 越界用例测试通过。\n2. 二级冒烟、david冒烟、st 用例通过\n<!--描述进行了哪些测试来验证你的改动。-->\n\n## 文档更新\n<!--如果这个PR包含文档的更新，请在这里指出。例如：更新了README.md文件。-->\n\n## 类型标签\n<!--  [x] 表示选中 -->\n- [x] Bug修复\n- [ ] 新特性\n- [ ] 性能优化\n- [ ] 文档更新\n- [ ] 其他，请描述：\n\n\n","assignees_number":8,"assignees":[{"id":"6822cc0d6a68fa1fec6cc502","login":"zhou-qilong","name":"sunday","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6880d13aba419813105ac7ab","login":"tangweiwei2","name":"tangweiwei2","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c65c6a68fa1fec6cc32e","login":"crystalhu","name":"胡碧霞","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/crystalhu","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68c267402134ad667af2b58f","login":"wangyongguang","name":"wangyongguang","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wangyongguang","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6861e48dadc5e31e4da8818d","login":"chenqi317","name":"chenqi317","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/chenqi317","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c634e4b985165b4b055f","login":"FelixTang7","name":"FelixTang7","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/FelixTang7","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6880ab8479db6d209b3bc340","login":"liubo75","name":"liubo75","htm